**proposition 16.9 (STL scope).** STL constructs and saturates the integer-coefficient structure of an existing golden dihedral packet. It does not change the existence condition h_p>=k+1, and supplies no new actual WSS example or non-WSS prime family. In particular L_int being nonzero was derived from the preselected eta, rather than proved without it.

